---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | Relaflow"
  description="Relaflow's Terms of Service explain the terms that apply to use of the website, newsletter, resources, training, and advisory services."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 pt-20 pb-16 md:px-10 md:pt-28 md:pb-20">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-display text-sm uppercase tracking-widest2 text-teal">
        Legal
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl leading-[1.1] sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-white/50">
        Last updated: 27 August 2026
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-12 text-white/75">

        <div>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            These Terms of Service govern your use of relaflow.com and your access to Relaflow's published content, resources, newsletter, training, and advisory services.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            By using the website, subscribing to our newsletter, accessing our resources, or engaging Relaflow for services, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree with these terms, please do not use the website or our services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            1. Who We Are
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow is a media, advisory, and training brand focused on the systems, methods, information, and workflows organizations use to effectively navigate and strengthen their vital relationships.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Our work includes published insights, guides, templates, frameworks, training, masterclasses, and advisory services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            2. Use of the Website
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            You may use relaflow.com for lawful personal or internal organizational purposes.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            You agree not to use the website or its content:
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed">
            <li>For any unlawful or fraudulent purpose</li>
            <li>To interfere with the operation or security of the website</li>
            <li>To attempt to gain unauthorized access to systems or information</li>
            <li>To reproduce, resell, or commercially redistribute Relaflow content without permission</li>
            <li>In a way that infringes the rights of Relaflow or another person or organization</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            3. Intellectual Property
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Unless otherwise stated, the content published by Relaflow is the intellectual property of Relaflow or is used with appropriate permission.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            This includes insights, articles, guides, templates, frameworks, playbooks, training materials, graphics, branding, written content, and other materials made available through the website.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            You may access and use free resources for your own personal or internal organizational purposes, subject to any specific terms provided with the resource.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Where a resource is purchased or otherwise provided under a specific license, that license permits use only as described by Relaflow at the time of purchase or access.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Unless we give you written permission, you may not sell, republish, reproduce, redistribute, sublicense, modify for redistribution, or commercially exploit Relaflow's resources or other protected content.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            4. Newsletter
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            By subscribing to The Business of Relationships Brief, you agree to receive newsletter communications from Relaflow through our newsletter provider.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            You may unsubscribe at any time using the unsubscribe option included in newsletter communications.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Newsletter subscriptions and delivery are managed through Substack and may also be subject to Substack's terms and policies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            5. Free and Paid Resources
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow may make certain guides, templates, frameworks, playbooks, training materials, and other resources available free of charge and may offer other resources or services for payment.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Any additional terms relating to a paid resource, including price, payment, access, permitted use, or delivery, will be provided at the time of purchase or access.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Access to a resource does not transfer ownership of the underlying intellectual property to you.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            6. Training Services
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow may provide training, masterclasses, workshops, and other learning services to organizations and individuals.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Specific terms for a training engagement, including scope, participants, fees, scheduling, delivery, cancellation, and other requirements, may be set out in a separate agreement or booking confirmation.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Training materials provided during an engagement remain the intellectual property of Relaflow unless otherwise agreed in writing.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            7. Advisory Services
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow may provide advisory and project-based support relating to relationship management, relationship operations, research, data, partnerships, sponsorships, communities, clients, and related organizational processes.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Specific terms for advisory engagements, including scope of work, deliverables, fees, timelines, confidentiality, intellectual property, data handling, and responsibilities of each party, will be set out in a separate written agreement between Relaflow and the client.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            If there is a conflict between these general Terms of Service and a signed engagement agreement, the signed engagement agreement will govern the relevant advisory engagement.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            8. No Guarantee of Results
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow's insights, guides, templates, frameworks, training, and other resources are intended to provide practical information and support better thinking and decision-making.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            They are not a guarantee of any particular business, financial, relationship, operational, or organizational outcome.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Results will depend on the circumstances of the organization, the decisions it makes, how resources are implemented, and other factors outside Relaflow's control.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Our published content is general in nature and should not be treated as professional, legal, financial, or other specialized advice tailored to your particular circumstances.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            9. Information and External Links
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We aim to keep our published information useful and accurate, but we do not guarantee that all information on the website will always be complete, current, or free from errors.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            The website may contain links to third-party websites or services. These links are provided for convenience or additional information. Relaflow does not control and is not responsible for the content, availability, privacy practices, or terms of third-party websites.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            10. Limitation of Liability
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            To the extent permitted by applicable law, Relaflow will not be liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or loss-of-profit damages arising from or related to your use of the website, newsletter, resources, training, or advisory services.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            This includes losses arising from reliance on information published through the website or from the use or inability to use our website or resources.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited under applicable law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            11. Confidentiality
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Information shared with Relaflow during an advisory or training engagement may be subject to confidentiality obligations.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Where confidentiality requirements are important to an engagement, the parties will establish the applicable obligations in a separate written agreement.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            12. Data Protection
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow's handling of personal information is described in our
            <a
              href="/legal/privacy-policy"
              class="text-teal hover:text-white"
            >
              Privacy Policy
            </a>.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Where an advisory or training engagement involves the processing of personal information on behalf of a client organization, additional data-protection requirements may be included in the relevant engagement agreement.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            13. Changes to the Website and Services
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Relaflow may update, change, suspend, or discontinue parts of the website, newsletter, resources, training offerings, or other services at any time.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We may also update published content or resource availability as our work develops.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            14. Changes to These Terms
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            We may update these Terms of Service from time to time to reflect changes in our services, business practices, or applicable legal requirements.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            The "Last updated" date at the top of this page indicates when these terms were most recently revised.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Continued use of the website or our services after updated terms are published constitutes acceptance of the revised terms, to the extent permitted by applicable law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            15. Governing Law
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            These Terms of Service are governed by the laws of Kenya, except where applicable law requires otherwise.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Any disputes relating to these terms or the use of the website will be subject to the applicable courts and dispute-resolution processes in Kenya, unless the parties agree otherwise or applicable law provides otherwise.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-white sm:text-3xl">
            16. Contact Us
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            If you have questions about these Terms of Service, please contact:
          </p>

          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-white">Relaflow</strong><br />
            <a
              href="mailto:hello@relaflow.com"
              class="text-teal hover:text-white"
            >
              hello@relaflow.com
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>